{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/backend/kotlin/basic/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"hyungkishin.blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"0fe06fb5-2771-57a0-87e8-4b442af84313","excerpt":"회원의 이름, 나이, 이메일을 보관하는 클래스를 코틀린으로 옮겨 보자. 아래 은 생성자 인수 세 개를 선언하면서 같은 이름의 프로퍼티도 만든다. IntelliJ의 코드 변환 기능으로 자바 선언과 비교해 볼 수 있다. 예제에 쓰인 코틀린 문법 에 붙인  덕분에 주 생성자의 프로퍼티를 기준으로 , , 이 생긴다. 만 쓰면 인스턴스를 만들 수 있다. 같은 파일…","html":"<p>회원의 이름, 나이, 이메일을 보관하는 클래스를 코틀린으로 옮겨 보자. 아래 <code class=\"language-text\">Person</code>은 생성자 인수 세 개를 선언하면서 같은 이름의 프로퍼티도 만든다. IntelliJ의 코드 변환 기능으로 자바 선언과 비교해 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">data</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token function\">Person</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> age<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Int<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> email<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">object</span> MyCompany <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"MyCompany\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> person <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">Person</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"이상훈\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">35</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"member@example.com\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span><span class=\"token expression\">MyCompany<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name</span><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span><span class=\"token expression\">person<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name</span><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>예제에 쓰인 코틀린 문법</h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Person</code>에 붙인 <code class=\"language-text\">data</code> 덕분에 주 생성자의 프로퍼티를 기준으로 <code class=\"language-text\">equals()</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">hashCode()</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">toString()</code>이 생긴다. <code class=\"language-text\">Person(...)</code>만 쓰면 인스턴스를 만들 수 있다.</p>\n<p>같은 파일의 <code class=\"language-text\">MyCompany</code>는 인스턴스 하나를 공유하는 <code class=\"language-text\">object</code>다. 맨 아래의 <code class=\"language-text\">main</code>은 어느 클래스에도 넣지 않은 최상위 함수다. 이 문법은 서버와 안드로이드 등 모바일 앱에서 모두 볼 수 있고, 코틀린은 프론트엔드의 JavaScript를 대상으로도 컴파일할 수 있다.</p>\n<h2>안드로이드의 코틀린 도입</h2>\n<p>Google Home 팀은 코틀린 도입 뒤 1년 동안 앱에서 <code class=\"language-text\">NullPointerException</code>으로 발생한 크래시가 33% 줄었다고 보고했다. 이 수치는 Google Home 앱에서 관찰한 변화다. <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/kotlin/build-better-apps\">Android 개발자 문서의 Google Home 사례</a></p>\n<h3>코틀린과 스프링, 안드로이드의 주요 발표</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>2016년 2월 코틀린 1.0 출시</li>\n<li>2017년 1월 Spring Framework 5.0의 코틀린 지원 발표</li>\n<li>2017년 5월 Google I/O에서 안드로이드의 코틀린 지원 발표</li>\n<li>2019년 5월 Google I/O에서 안드로이드 개발의 Kotlin-first 방침 발표</li>\n<li>2022년 5월 코틀린 1.7 베타 출시</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>자바 문법을 코틀린으로 옮기면</h2>\n<h3>체크 예외</h3>\n<p>자바에서는 메서드가 선언한 체크 예외에 호출자가 대응해야 한다. 파일을 열다 발생하는 <code class=\"language-text\">IOException</code>과 그 하위 타입 <code class=\"language-text\">FileNotFoundException</code>이 그 예다. <code class=\"language-text\">Throwable</code>의 다른 계열인 <code class=\"language-text\">Error</code>에는 <code class=\"language-text\">OutOfMemoryError</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">StackOverflowError</code>가 있다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">NullPointerException</code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException</code>은 <code class=\"language-text\">RuntimeException</code>에 속한다. 컴파일러는 이 예외의 처리를 강제하지 않는다. Spring의 기본 트랜잭션 설정에서 체크 예외로도 롤백하려면 <code class=\"language-text\">@Transactional</code>의 <code class=\"language-text\">rollbackFor</code>에 해당 타입을 지정한다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 1rem;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 760px; '>\n      <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 63.15789473684211%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='img.png' title='' src='/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/efd7b/img.png' srcset='/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/08678/img.png 190w,\n/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/2edd7/img.png 380w,\n/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/efd7b/img.png 760w,\n/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/dc896/img.png 1140w,\n/static/bed4c7cee13c8413ce5eafe30d7203d6/a7903/img.png 1219w' sizes='(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>img.png</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>호출자가 인터럽트를 처리하려면 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code>에서 인터럽트 상태를 복원하고 작업을 끝낼 수 있다. 호출자에게 넘기려면 메서드의 <code class=\"language-text\">throws</code> 절에 선언한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">waitBriefly</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Thread</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">sleep</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">InterruptedException</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Thread</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">currentThread</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">interrupt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>코틀린 호출자는 같은 자바 메서드를 호출할 때도 체크 예외 처리를 강제받지 않는다. 복구 동작이 필요하다면 <code class=\"language-text\">try/catch</code>를 쓸 수 있다.</p>\n<h3>기본 자료형</h3>\n<p>자바에서는 기본형 <code class=\"language-text\">int</code>와 래퍼 클래스 <code class=\"language-text\">Integer</code>를 구분한다. 다음 코드에서 <code class=\"language-text\">toString()</code>을 호출하는 대상은 <code class=\"language-text\">Integer</code>다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token class-name\">Integer</span> boxed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> boxed<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toString</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>코틀린에서는 같은 값을 <code class=\"language-text\">Int</code>로 선언하고 곧바로 <code class=\"language-text\">toString()</code>을 호출한다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 1rem;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 760px; '>\n      <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRooAAABXRUJQVlA4IH4AAAAwBACdASoUAAoAPtFUo0uoJKMhsAgBABoJZQAD4lmK4CBmZo0HLE+tgAAA/OPucJQr54zMJGGDCrLdqGdaSEGIcZIpIxBpXz8gPFjhAaYhIstZHmxmWqcovKzCE93jCR/+g+LlsRmHrQa//Ui28ImBA/ibAz6osgMOzkPX4AA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='한 검표원은 0이 적힌 카드를 비닐 슬리브에 넣은 뒤 구멍을 뚫고, 옆 검표원은 슬리브 없이 같은 카드를 바로 뚫는다.' title='' src='/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/7df04/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp' srcset='/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/561c4/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp 190w,\n/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/3e041/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp 380w,\n/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/7df04/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp 760w,\n/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/b2cd5/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp 1140w,\n/static/f352d04d523c8ed18b987416fd7bef17/94b1e/scene-bare-int-ticket-punch.webp 1280w' sizes='(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>한 검표원은 0이 적힌 카드를 비닐 슬리브에 넣은 뒤 구멍을 뚫고, 옆 검표원은 슬리브 없이 같은 카드를 바로 뚫는다.</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> value<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Int <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toString</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>소스에서 메서드를 호출하더라도 JVM이 정수마다 객체를 만들 필요는 없다. 컴파일러는 null을 허용하지 않는 <code class=\"language-text\">Int</code>를 보통 JVM의 <code class=\"language-text\">int</code>로 표현한다. <code class=\"language-text\">Int?</code>처럼 null도 담아야 하는 자리에서는 래퍼 타입을 사용한다. <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/numbers.html\">Kotlin의 숫자 타입</a></p>\n<h3>정적 멤버</h3>\n<p>자바의 <code class=\"language-text\">static</code> 멤버는 인스턴스를 만들지 않고 클래스 이름으로 접근한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">JavaClass</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> count <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"token function\">currentCount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> count<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>코틀린에서는 클래스 안의 <code class=\"language-text\">companion object</code>에 함수를 두고 <code class=\"language-text\">KotlinClass.currentCount()</code>처럼 호출할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> KotlinClass <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">companion</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">object</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> count <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">currentCount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Int <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> count\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>삼항 연산자</h3>\n<p>자바에서는 조건에 따라 값을 고르는 데 <code class=\"language-text\">? :</code>를 쓴다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> animal <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"호랑이\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> animalSound <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"호랑이\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>animal<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">?</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"어흥\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"야홍\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>코틀린에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">if</code>와 <code class=\"language-text\">else</code> 두 분기에서 나온 값을 바로 대입한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> animal <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"호랑이\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> animalSound <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>animal <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"호랑이\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"어흥\"</span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"야홍\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>세미콜론</h3>\n<p>자바에서는 아래 대입문 끝에 세미콜론을 쓴다. 코틀린에서는 줄이 끝나는 곳의 세미콜론을 생략할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> isAdmin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> isAdmin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>코틀린에서 쓸 수 있는 표현</h2>\n<h3>확장 함수</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">String</code>을 직접 수정하지 않아도 확장 함수를 마침표로 호출할 수 있다. 여기서는 빈 문자열을 받으면 <code class=\"language-text\">firstLetter()</code>의 인덱스 접근이 실패하므로 값이 있는 문자열로 시험한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">firstLetter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Char <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addFirst</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>char<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Char<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> char <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"ABCD\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">firstLetter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// A</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"ABCD\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addFirst</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token char\">'Z'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// ZABCD</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3>데이터 클래스</h3>\n<p>아래의 <code class=\"language-text\">Person</code>은 이름과 나이를 <code class=\"language-text\">val</code>로 선언해 생성 후 두 프로퍼티에 다른 값을 대입할 수 없다. 데이터를 보관하고 전달할 때 이런 형태를 쓸 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">data</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token function\">Person</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> age<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Int<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>자바에서 같은 두 값을 일반 클래스로 보관할 때는 생성자에서 <code class=\"language-text\">final</code> 필드를 초기화한다. 접근자는 아래처럼 작성하거나 Lombok의 <code class=\"language-text\">@Getter</code>로 생성할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Person</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> age<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Person</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> age<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>age <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> age<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> <span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"token function\">getAge</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> age<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Java 16에서 정식 기능이 된 <code class=\"language-text\">record</code>는 생성자, 컴포넌트 접근자, <code class=\"language-text\">equals()</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">hashCode()</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">toString()</code>을 선언 한 줄에서 제공한다. 위 클래스와 아래 레코드는 서로 다른 <code class=\"language-text\">Person.java</code> 예시다. <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/jeps/395\">OpenJDK JEP 395</a></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">record</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Person</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> age<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>문자열 템플릿</h3>\n<p>문자열에 변수 하나를 넣을 때는 <code class=\"language-text\">$text</code>, 표현식을 넣을 때는 <code class=\"language-text\">${...}</code>를 쓴다. 주문 조회처럼 조건이 달라지는 SQL에서는 조건절을 선택해 넣고 실제 값은 파라미터로 바인딩할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">sql</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nameIncluded<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Boolean<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> nameCondition <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nameIncluded<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\" AND name = :name\"</span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-literal multiline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"\"\"\n        SELECT id, name, email, age\n        FROM users\n        WHERE id = :id</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">$</span><span class=\"token expression\">nameCondition</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    \"\"\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">trimIndent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"World\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"Hello, </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">$</span><span class=\"token expression\">text</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token function\">sql</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>nameIncluded <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>함께 살펴볼 언어 기능</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">if (value is String)</code>처럼 타입을 검사하면 조건이 참인 분기에서 스마트 캐스트로 문자열의 멤버를 쓸 수 있다. <code class=\"language-text\">sealed class</code>는 직접 상속할 수 있는 타입의 범위를 제한한다. 코틀린 자체의 언어 기능이다. 이 밖에도 위임, 중위 표현식, 연산자 오버로딩, 코루틴을 지원한다. <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/docs/sealed-classes.html\">Kotlin의 sealed 클래스</a></p>\n<h2>스프링 공식 문서에서 코틀린 예제 찾기</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/web/webmvc/mvc-servlet.html\">Spring MVC 문서</a>에서 언어 탭이 있는 예제는 Java와 Kotlin 코드를 번갈아 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<p><figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 1rem;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 760px; '>\n      <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 33.68421052631579%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='img_1.png' title='' src='/static/91afd7f1810be84d0b8328323c194071/efd7b/img_1.png' srcset='/static/91afd7f1810be84d0b8328323c194071/08678/img_1.png 190w,\n/static/91afd7f1810be84d0b8328323c194071/2edd7/img_1.png 380w,\n/static/91afd7f1810be84d0b8328323c194071/efd7b/img_1.png 760w,\n/static/91afd7f1810be84d0b8328323c194071/d9c1b/img_1.png 1040w' sizes='(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>img_1.png</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<h2>Spring Initializr로 코틀린 프로젝트 만들기</h2>\n<p>Spring Initializr에서 언어를 Kotlin, 빌드 방식을 Gradle Kotlin DSL로 선택하면 <code class=\"language-text\">build.gradle.kts</code>가 생긴다. 아래는 당시 예제의 Spring Boot 2.6.7, Kotlin 1.6.21과 Java 11을 유지한 설정이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>jetbrains<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kotlin<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>gradle<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>KotlinCompile\n\nplugins <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> version <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"2.6.7\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"io.spring.dependency-management\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> version <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"1.0.11.RELEASE\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">kotlin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"jvm\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> version <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"1.6.21\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">kotlin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"plugin.spring\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> version <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"1.6.21\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\ngroup <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"com.example\"</span></span>\nversion <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"0.0.1-SNAPSHOT\"</span></span>\njava<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sourceCompatibility <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> JavaVersion<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>VERSION_11\n\nrepositories <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">mavenCentral</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\ndependencies <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">implementation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">implementation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-reflect\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">implementation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-stdlib-jdk8\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">testImplementation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-test\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\ntasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>withType<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>KotlinCompile<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">configureEach</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    kotlinOptions <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        freeCompilerArgs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">listOf</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"-Xjsr305=strict\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        jvmTarget <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"11\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\ntasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>withType<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Test<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">configureEach</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">useJUnitPlatform</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">kotlin(\"plugin.spring\")</code>은 스프링이 프록시를 만들 때 필요한 클래스와 멤버를 열어 준다. <code class=\"language-text\">kotlin-reflect</code>는 런타임에 코틀린 타입 정보를 읽는 데 쓰이고, 표준 라이브러리는 <code class=\"language-text\">kotlin-stdlib</code>이 제공한다. JPA 엔티티용 생성자가 필요하거나 Jackson으로 코틀린 클래스를 읽어야 한다면 프로젝트에 맞춰 <code class=\"language-text\">plugin.jpa</code>나 <code class=\"language-text\">jackson-module-kotlin</code>을 추가한다.</p>\n<h2>스프링 부트 애플리케이션 실행하기</h2>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">src/main/kotlin/com/example/demo/DemoApplication.kt</code>에 진입점을 둔다. 최상위 함수 <code class=\"language-text\">main</code>이 스프링에 시작할 클래스와 실행 인자를 넘긴다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">package</span> com<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>example<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>demo\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>springframework<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>boot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>autoconfigure<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>SpringBootApplication\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>springframework<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>boot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>properties<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ConfigurationPropertiesScan\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>springframework<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>boot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>runApplication\n\n<span class=\"token annotation builtin\">@SpringBootApplication</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation builtin\">@ConfigurationPropertiesScan</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> DemoApplication\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>args<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Array<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>String<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    runApplication<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>DemoApplication<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span>args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>@ConfigurationProperties</h3>\n<p>이 예제의 Spring Boot 2.6.7에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">@ConstructorBinding</code>으로 설정값을 생성자 인수에 바인딩한다. 다음 클래스를 <code class=\"language-text\">DemoApplication</code>과 같은 패키지에 두면 위의 <code class=\"language-text\">@ConfigurationPropertiesScan</code>이 찾아서 등록한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">package</span> com<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>example<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>demo\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> java<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>net<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>URI\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>springframework<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>boot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>properties<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ConfigurationProperties\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>springframework<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>boot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>properties<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ConstructorBinding\n\n<span class=\"token annotation builtin\">@ConstructorBinding</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation builtin\">@ConfigurationProperties</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"example.kotlin\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">data</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token function\">KotlinExampleProperties</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> description<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> myService<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> MyService\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">data</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token function\">MyService</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> apiToken<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> String<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">val</span> uri<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> URI<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">src/main/resources/application.yml</code>에 생성자에 필요한 값을 채운다. 아래 주소와 토큰은 로컬 예시다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"yaml\"><pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">kotlin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> demo\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">description</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Local example\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">my-service</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"token key atrule\">api-token</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> local<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>example\n      <span class=\"token key atrule\">uri</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> https<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//example.com</code></pre></div>\n<p>프로젝트 루트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">./gradlew bootRun</code>으로 실행한다. 이 예제에는 웹 의존성이 없어 HTTP 서버를 시작하지 않는다.</p>\n<h3>테스트 지원</h3>\n<p>앞의 빌드 설정은 <code class=\"language-text\">spring-boot-starter-test</code>와 <code class=\"language-text\">useJUnitPlatform()</code>으로 JUnit 5 테스트를 실행한다. 서비스의 의존성을 테스트 대역으로 바꿀 때는 Mockito를 쓰거나 코틀린용 MockK를 추가할 수 있다.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"자바 개발자가 읽는 코틀린의 데이터 클래스와 타입","description":"자바로 쓰던 회원 클래스를 코틀린의 data class로 옮기면 어떤 코드가 사라질까? 예외 처리와 기본 자료형도 두 언어로 비교했다.","date":"2024년 1월 12일","update":"2026년 11월 15일","isoDate":"2024-01-12T00:00:00.000Z","isoUpdate":"2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["코틀린"]},"fields":{"slug":"/backend/kotlin/basic/"}},"seriesPosts":{"nodes":[]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/devops/deploy-strategy/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"배포 중 들어온 주문은 어느 버전이 받을까"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/backend/spring/cpu-bound-vs-io-bound/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"웹 서버에서 CPU 작업과 I/O 대기를 구분하는 이유"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"0fe06fb5-2771-57a0-87e8-4b442af84313","seriesId":"__none__","previousPostId":"e9bfd9e8-3f59-5c17-b91c-c7c6d125c689","nextPostId":"2d7b5148-8648-5411-9dc6-f0ed28469657","previousLabel":null,"nextLabel":null}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}